## Quick start

Create the profile file, point the CLI at the API and store the token it
authenticates with:

```bash
{{ cli_name }} config init
{{ cli_name }} config set --param baseUrl --value {{ profile_defaults.baseUrl }}
{{ cli_name }} config set --param accessToken --value <token>
```

